{"id":"ccbc12:problem:c-metac","answer":"ROUND DANCE","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>观察小题答案的首字母。注意有些答案是两个单词，它们有两个首字母。</p>","text":"观察小题答案的首字母。注意有些答案是两个单词，它们有两个首字母。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"听不出音高怎么办？","html":"<p>这里有一个<a data-asset-id=\"asset-230f91a8c16dca660a898c9c\" href=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/c/521e07138edd48748ad55fbef575b49e.mid\">midi文件</a>。可以使用Audacity或者MuseScore打开来看到五线谱。</p>","text":"这里有一个\nmidi文件\n。可以使用Audacity或者MuseScore打开来看到五线谱。","assetIds":["asset-230f91a8c16dca660a898c9c"]},{"number":3,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>每个和弦里对应两个答案唯一重合的字母（忽略空格）。</p>","text":"每个和弦里对应两个答案唯一重合的字母（忽略空格）。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>音频里有十个和弦，每一个和弦都包含两个在C4和B4之间的音符，而且包含了半音音阶里的所有音高：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"答案参考\" data-asset-id=\"asset-11afdd32906a555e654a3881\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/c-meta.png\"/></p>\n<p>同时，注意到本区所有小题答案单词的首字母都是A-G之间，所以可以和十二个音高一一对应（两个单词的答案的两个首字母在音阶上是连续的，所以对应这两个字母之间的半音）：</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1738</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>A</span><span>MERICAN </span><span>B</span><span>EAUTY</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>A#</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1764</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>D</span><span>OUBLE </span><span>E</span><span>LIMINATION</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>D#</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1799</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>D</span><span>ECADE</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>D</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1865</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>G</span><span>YMNAST</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>G</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1893</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>F</span><span>RANCHISE</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>F</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1909</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>C</span><span>RUDE</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>C</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1921</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>A</span><span>NAEROBIC</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>A</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1957</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>C</span><span>ONAN </span><span>D</span><span>OYLE</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>C#</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1984</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>F</span><span>IELD </span><span>G</span><span>OAL</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>F#</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1986</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>B</span><span>ACKGAMMON</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>B</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2005</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>G</span><span>ENERAL </span><span>A</span><span>SSEMBLY</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>G#</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2068</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span><span>E</span><span>NSUED</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>E</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>每一个和弦对应的两个答案恰有一个位置的字母相同（忽略空格），所以按照音频顺序提取相同字母得到答案：<strong>ROUND DANCE</strong>。</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>C</span>