tr><td><p><span>B</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>BACKG</span><span><strong>A</strong></span></span><span>MMON</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>F</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>FRA</span><span><strong>N</strong></span><span>CHISE</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>N</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>G</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>GYM</span><span><strong>N</strong></span></span><span>AST</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>D</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>DE</span><span><strong>C</strong></span><span>ADE</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>C</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>B</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>BA</span><span><strong>C</strong></span></span><span>KGAMMON</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>F#</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>FI</span><span><strong>E</strong></span><span>LDGOAL</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>E</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>A#</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>AM</span><span><strong>E</strong></span></span><span>RICANBEAUTY</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>","text":"音频里有十个和弦，每一个和弦都包含两个在C4和B4之间的音符，而且包含了半音音阶里的所有音高：\n\n同时，注意到本区所有小题答案单词的首字母都是A-G之间，所以可以和十二个音高一一对应（两个单词的答案的两个首字母在音阶上是连续的，所以对应这两个字母之间的半音）：\n\n1738\nA\nMERICAN\nB\nEAUTY\nA#\n1764\nD\nOUBLE\nE\nLIMINATION\nD#\n1799\nD\nECADE\nD\n1865\nG\nYMNAST\nG\n1893\nF\nRANCHISE\nF\n1909\nC\nRUDE\nC\n1921\nA\nNAEROBIC\nA\n1957\nC\nONAN\nD\nOYLE\nC#\n1984\nF\nIELD\nG\nOAL\nF#\n1986\nB\nACKGAMMON\nB\n2005\nG\nENERAL\nA\nSSEMBLY\nG#\n2068\nE\nNSUED\nE\n\n每一个和弦对应的两个答案恰有一个位置的字母相同（忽略空格），所以按照音频顺序提取相同字母得到答案：\nROUND DANCE\n。\n\nC\nC\nR\nUDE\nR\nF\nF\nR\nANCHISE\nC#\nC\nO\nNANDOYLE\nO\nD#\nD\nO\nUBLEELIMINATION\nC\nCR\nU\nDE\nU\nD#\nDO\nU\nBLEELIMINATION\nE\nE\nN\nSUED\nN\nA\nA\nN\nAEROBIC\nD\nDECA\nD\nE\nD\nF#\nFIEL\nD\nGOAL\nC#\nCONAN\nD\nOYLE\nD\nE\nENSUE\nD\nG#\nGENER\nA\nLASSEMBLY\nA\nB\nBACKG\nA\nMMON\nF\nFRA\nN\nCHISE\nN\nG\nGYM\nN\nAST\nD\nDE\nC\nADE\nC\nB\nBA\nC\nKGAMMON\nF#\nFI\nE\nLDGOAL\nE\nA#\nAM\nE\nRICANBEAUTY","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-11afdd32906a555e654a3881"]},"extended":{"html":"<p>救出wilsey后，这个人一直在开心地哼着歌，说实话有点吵。</p>","text":"救出wilsey后，这个人一直在开心地哼着歌，说实话有点吵。","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-11afdd32906a555e654a3881","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/c-meta.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/c-meta.png","mime":"image/png","size":8095,"sha256":"39e13a4f200132aae78c82053f01a94b67489ae7b10674e24aa5c4b7a9eab645","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-230f91a8c16dca660a898c9c","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/c/521e07138edd48748ad55fbef575b49e.mid","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/c/521e07138edd48748ad55fbef575b49e.mid","mime":"audio/midi","size":213,"sha256":"da6ca718cf9ba1ff17621650b53e5a89b545780bba55443d88c8ccb55afb78fe","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["hint:2"]}]}
